
<p>Apple Newsroom yesterday:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>With the 27.2 software updates released today, Siri AI — an
entirely new version of Siri that is profoundly more capable,
conversational, and personal — is expanding to more people around
the world, with availability now in the French, Japanese, Korean,
Portuguese, and Spanish languages. [...]</p>

<p>Siri AI is currently unavailable in the EU in iOS, iPadOS, and
watchOS. Apple is working constructively with the EU in an attempt
to find a path forward.</p>
</blockquote>

<p>Don’t hold your breath. (Or if you prefer, <em>N’y comptez pas trop.</em>)</p>

